OL,3,AAll six passengers presumed dead after
OL,4,Aplane went missing off US coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people aboard a medical transport
OL,7,Faircraft that went missing on Saturday
OL,8,Fwhile it was travelling from Bermuda to
OL,9,FBoston are presumed dead, according to
OL,10,Fa statement from the flight's operator.
OL,12,FOn Sunday evening, the United States
OL,13,FCoast Guard said it was ending its
OL,14,Fsearch for survivors off the coast of
OL,15,FNantucket, a Massachusetts island.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
