OL,3,AAll six passengers presumed dead after
OL,4,Aplane went missing off US coast
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We must now face the heartbreaking
OL,7,Freality that the four members of our
OL,8,FLatitude team, our patient and the
OL,9,Fpatient's family escort, who were
OL,10,Faboard Heartbeat 104, are presumed to
OL,11,Fhave died," Latitude Air Ambulance said
OL,12,Fin a statement shortly thereafter.
OL,14,F"Our thoughts are first and foremost
OL,15,Fwith their families, loved ones,
OL,16,Ffriends, and colleagues."
